1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:10,650
More and more college students are taking part in community service, and this is a welcome trend for both students and society.
越来越多的大学生参与社区服务，无论对学生还是对社会，这都是一个可喜的趋势。

2
00:00:11,450 --> 00:00:14,330
Community service benefits students in many ways.
社区服务在许多方面让学生受益。

3
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:22,710
It allows them to apply what they have learned in class to real life and develops practical skills such as communication and teamwork.
它让学生能把课堂上学到的知识应用到现实生活中，并培养沟通、团队合作等实用技能。

4
00:00:23,510 --> 00:00:30,970
Working with people from different backgrounds also helps them understand society better and become more responsible citizens.
与来自不同背景的人一起工作，也能帮助他们更好地了解社会，成为更有责任感的公民。

5
00:00:31,770 --> 00:00:38,300
At the same time, the community gains energy and fresh ideas from young volunteers who are eager to help.
与此同时，社区也从热心助人的年轻志愿者那里获得活力和新鲜的想法。

6
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:43,750
As a computer science major, I can offer something practical to my community.
作为一名计算机科学专业的学生，我能为社区提供一些实实在在的帮助。

7
00:00:44,550 --> 00:00:54,250
Many elderly residents find it difficult to use smartphones, so I would like to teach them how to make video calls, pay bills online and book doctor’s appointments.
许多老年居民觉得使用智能手机很困难，所以我想教他们如何打视频电话、在网上缴费以及预约看医生。

8
00:00:55,050 --> 00:01:02,120
In addition, I can tutor children in math and English on weekends, especially those whose parents are busy at work.
此外，周末我还可以给孩子们辅导数学和英语，尤其是那些父母工作繁忙的孩子。

9
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:10,860
Through such service, I hope to make a small but real difference in people’s lives while growing into a more capable person myself.
通过这样的服务，我希望在让自己成长为更有能力的人的同时，为人们的生活带来虽小却实实在在的改变。
